  "description": "Fuel their competitive fire and skyrocket their progression with a machine born directly from the gravity scene. The COMMENCAL RAMONES 14 PUSH BIKE GREEN drops the city-bike act to give your kid an aggressive, high-performance stance that commands respect at the local pumptrack. This is about building immediate rider instinct, explosive confidence, and lightning-fast balance control that leaves training wheels in the dust.\n• Pro Foot Platform: Built-in anti-slip standing zone engineered for advanced coasting mechanics and total paint defense.\n• RIDE ALPHA Cockpit: Superlight aluminum steering system with downsized grip diameters tailored for instant handling responsiveness.\n• Oversized Dirt Tyres: Beefy VEE TIRE CrownGem rubber serves up massive stability and cushion to dominate any dirt park or sidewalk.\n• Race Grade Upgradeable: Integrated rear disc tabs unlock real-deal stopping power options for toddlers pushing extreme speed limits.\nFast-track your mini-shredder's balance skills today with the ultimate performance-bred American dirt track trainer.",
